# This repo root (source\repos) holds many unrelated projects.
# Only the SimpleBrokeredMessaging solution is tracked here.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# Un-ignore the SimpleBrokeredMessaging solution folders + repo scaffolding
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging/
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.ChatConsole/
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.Receiver/
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.Sender/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Un-ignore their contents
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging/**
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.ChatConsole/**
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.Receiver/**
!/SimpleBrokeredMessaging.Sender/**

# Re-exclude build artifacts / IDE state inside the tracked folders
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
